</style></head><body><div class="nav"><b>O2O Tradition</b><div><a href="home.php">Home</a><a href="rewards.php">Rewards</a></div></div><main class="main"><section class="hero"><h1>♻ Eco & Circular Fashion</h1><p>See how your Rent, Swap, Resale and upcycling activity keeps traditional fashion in circulation.</p></section><?php if($message):?><div class="msg"><?=htmlspecialchars($message)?></div><?php endif;?><section class="card"><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="num"><?=$rentalCount?></div><div class="label">Completed rentals</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="num"><?=$swapCount?></div><div class="label">Completed swaps</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="num"><?=$resaleCount?></div><div class="label">Resales</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="num"><?=$upCount?></div><div class="label">Upcycled</div></div></div><p class="small" style="margin-top:15px"><b><?=$total?></b> recorded circular-fashion activities. These counts describe marketplace activity; they are not a scientific measurement of carbon or waste avoided.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Eco-Luxe / Upcycled</h2><p class="small">Did you upcycle a traditional garment or accessory? Record it here so your circular-fashion history stays visible.</p><form class="form" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($_SESSION['csrf_token'])?>"><input type="hidden" name="event_type" value="upcycled"><input class="input" name="note" maxlength="255" placeholder="e.g. Restyled an old silk saree into a festive outfit"><button class="btn">Record Activity</button></form></section><section class="card"><h2>Your circular history</h2><?php foreach($events as $e):?><div class="badge"><?=htmlspecialchars(str_replace('_',' ',$e['event_type']))?> · <?=date('d M Y',strtotime($e['created_at']))?><?php if($e['note']):?> · <?=htmlspecialchars($e['note'])?><?php endif;?></div><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$events):?><p class="small">No manually recorded circular activities yet. Completed marketplace activity is reflected in the summary above.</p><?php endif;?></section><section class="card"><b>About the metric</b><p class="small">O2O Tradition records reuse-related marketplace actions rather than estimating environmental impact. A rental, swap or resale represents an additional circulation event, but the platform does not claim a specific carbon or waste saving from an individual transaction.</p></section></main></body></html>